  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of volume expansion of glycerine is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>49</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The fractional change in its density for a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> rise in temperature will be"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1.45</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
